msgid "autoOpenView/boxCount"
msgid_plural "plural/autoOpenView/boxCount"
msgstr[0] "%(count) remaining module"
msgstr[1] "%(count) remaining modules"
msgstr[2] "%(count) remaining modules"

msgid "awardViews/footer/backButton/"
msgstr "Back to Modules"

msgid "boxTooltip/description/text/wt"
msgstr ""
"When opened, these modules may grant you Premium vehicles, in-game "
"currencies, and other valuable rewards."

msgid "boxTooltip/howGet/text/wt"
msgstr "Paradoxmoduls can be obtained in the in-game Store or Premium Shop."

msgid "common/boxCategory/lowerCase/wt"
msgstr "Paradoxmodul"

msgid "common/boxCategory/upperCase/wt"
msgstr "PARADOXMODUL"

msgid "common/getButton/lowerCase"
msgstr "Get Modules"

msgid "common/getButton/upperCase"
msgstr "GET MODULES"

msgid "common/loader"
msgstr "Module opening..."

msgid "common/statistics/emptyHeader"
msgstr "Open modules to view statistics."

msgid "common/statistics/header"
msgstr "Modules opened: %(count)"

msgid "common/statistics/tooltip/body"
msgstr ""
"Here you can view the items you received from modules during the event. You "
"can manually reset these statistics at any time."

msgid "confirmResetLootBoxStatistics/description"
msgstr "All information on opened modules will be deleted."

msgid "entryPoint/boxes"
msgstr "TO MODULES"

msgid "entryPoint/tooltip/description"
msgstr ""
"These are special modules containing new and unique items, including Premium vehicles, customization elements, in-game currencies, and other valuable rewards.\n"
"Modules can be obtained from the in-game Store or Premium Shop."

msgid "entryPoint/tooltip/title"
msgstr "Modules and How to Receive Them"

msgid "entryPoint/tooltip/warningDescription"
msgstr ""
"Modules cannot currently be opened or obtained due to technical reasons. We "
"apologize for the temporary inconvenience."

msgid "entryPoint/tooltip/warningTitle"
msgstr "Modules Temporarily Unavailable"

msgid "eventName/lowerCase"
msgstr "Break the Paradox"

msgid "eventName/upperCase"
msgstr "BREAK THE PARADOX"

msgid "guaranteedTitle/nextBox"
msgstr "Guaranteed Reward in the next module!"

msgid "guaranteedTitle/text"
msgstr "Maximum modules before a Guaranteed Reward: %(count)"

msgid "infoPage/footer/description/autoOpen"
msgstr ""
"If you do not open modules before the end of the event, they will be opened "
"automatically."

msgid "infoPage/footer/description/compensation"
msgstr ""
"If you already own all vehicles from the list of possible module contents, "
"then all subsequent vehicles you receive from modules will be compensated in"
" gold equal to their full value."

msgid "infoPage/footer/description/guaranteed"
msgstr ""
"Every %(guaranteed0)s modules are guaranteed to contain a Premium vehicle. "
"If you open them without one dropping such a vehicle, then a Premium vehicle"
" you do not already own will drop when you open the %(guaranteed0)sth "
"module. When it does, the counter is reset."

msgid "infoPage/header/description"
msgstr ""
"Open the module for the chance to receive valuable in-game items! See more "
"details below."

msgid "multipleRewardView/header/subTitle/"
msgstr "From the %(name) (%(boxesCount) modules opened)"

msgid "noBoxesView/description/"
msgstr ""
"You do not have any modules. You can get them\n"
"in the in-game Store or the Premium Shop."

msgid "preview/backLabel"
msgstr "TO MODULES"

msgid "quantityTitle/boxesAvailable"
msgstr "Modules available: %(boxesCount)"

msgid "quantityTitle/noBoxes"
msgstr "No modules available"

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/finish/text"
msgstr ""
"All remaining modules will be opened. Their contents will be added to your "
"account."

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/lootBoxesAutoOpen/count"
msgstr "Modules opened: %(boxes)s"

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/lootBoxesAutoOpen/header"
msgstr "Remaining Modules Opened"

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/lootBoxesAutoOpen/text"
msgstr ""
"At the end of the event, we opened all of your modules and added their "
"contents to your account."

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/lootBoxesDisabled/header"
msgstr "Module Opening Suspended"

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/lootBoxesDisabled/text"
msgstr ""
"Operations with modules are temporarily unavailable due to maintenance."

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/lootBoxesEnabled/header"
msgstr "Module Opening Available"

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/lootBoxesEnabled/text"
msgstr "Operations with modules are available again. Open them!"

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/multipleOpen"
msgstr "Modules opened!"

msgid "serviceChannelMessages/server_error"
msgstr "Module Not Opened"

msgid "singleRewardView/tooltip/description/"
msgstr ""
"If you already own all the vehicles from the list of possible module "
"contents, then all subsequent vehicles you receive from modules will be "
"compensated in gold."

msgid "singleRewardView/tooltip/remainingCount"
msgid_plural "plural/singleRewardView/tooltip/remainingCount"
msgstr[0] "%(remainingCount) module"
msgstr[1] "%(remainingCount) modules"
msgstr[2] "%(remainingCount) modules"

msgid "singleRewardView/tooltip/subtitle/"
msgstr ""
"The Guaranteed Reward is a vehicle from the list of possible module contents.\n"
"If you open %(remainingCount) modules without one dropping such a vehicle, it will drop when you open the %(count) module. When it does, the counter is reset."
